conference.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2018 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2019-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Increased beverage can volumes and the pass-through of higher material costs were offset by lower food can volumes and currency translation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2018 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2019-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"As a reminder and as discussed previously double-digit increases in both tinplate steel and aluminum in 2018 were successfully passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2019-04-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"They're going to do auto stock and so supply is another issue, just given the tariff situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/18/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2019-04-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"And the tariff situation is not something that's sustainable just given the amount of aluminum that needs to come into the country to deal with domestic supply or domestic demand needs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/18/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2019-04-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"So, the denominator effect on a one-for-one pass-through just in percentage terms, reduces the margin, not the absolute margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/18/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2019-04-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Edlain Rodriguez","x":"Is it a question of demand is going to have to pickup, where everyone want to be willing to raise prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/18/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2019-07-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Selling price realization was positive -- was not enough to offset inflationary cost increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/18/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2019-07-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"So, these are all items around the edge, which in a tight margin business items around the edge have an impact, but we'll do better on price realization versus cost next year, and we'll see where brings us, but I -- this year has been disappointing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/18/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2019-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Now, depending on whatever trade deal we cut with China, some of the metal may carry a tariff and some may not.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2019-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"We can currently source metal from a variety of countries that are not tariff impacted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2019-10-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were down 3% versus prior year largely due to the pass-through of lower aluminum costs and $64 million of unfavorable currency translation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2019-10-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"As described to you in July, selling price realization was positive in 2019, but not enough to cover inflationary cost increases and this accounts for the $6 million decline in segment income in the third quarter, as our cost reduction efforts offset the impact from lower volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2019-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"I know, we have one plant we've talked about rightsizing in the European Food footprint, but we've done so much reorganization in that footprint over the last 15 years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2019-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"…to be volume from the new facilities and we're going to be -- continue to become more cost effective, where we really did a good job on cost this year whether it was rightsizing our freight not sourcing cans from others, performance improvement in Nichols, and we're going to continue to do that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2020-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Today, delivered aluminum is about $0.14 a pound cheaper than this time last year, so as we are on pass-through for almost all aluminum, this will result in lower reported revenues in the beverage can businesses but have no impact on absolute margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2020-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"As we have discussed with you in earlier quarters the 2019, selling price increase was not enough to cover inflationary cost increases, including tinplate steel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Now, does that mean we need to do some restructuring, close one or two plants?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2019 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tyler Langton","x":"And then I guess, Tom, could you just give a little bit on the -- for free cash flow to some of the other components, assumptions like working capital, pension, restructuring [Speech Overlap]?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2020-04-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were flat versus prior year as increased beverage can volumes were offset by $40 million of unfavorable currency translation and the pass-through of lower raw material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2020-04-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"We remind you that the pass-through of lower raw material costs, that is tinplate steel down mid-single digits and delivered aluminum down more than 10% from last year will offset unit volume growth on the revenue line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Employees will take vacation before they're temporarily laid off and then we'll look to bring them back in the summer or later months as demand picks up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"So there are some things we can do, but the equipment is in place and beyond that much of the -- much of what you're describing would be headcount reduction, and that's something you can't afford to do in a business that requires high skills.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2020-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were down from the prior year due to the impact of the coronavirus pandemic on unit volumes, the pass-through of lower material costs and $73 million of unfavorable currency translations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/21/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2020-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Arun Viswanathan","x":"I guess, would that -- with those customer commitments and contracting process include potential for price increases in North America and Europe as well?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/21/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2020-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were up 3% from the prior year due to increased beverage and food can volumes offset by the pass-through of lower material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2020-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"I think just like in the can industry, margins sometimes are impacted by the cost of the raw material because you're passing through steel and aluminum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2020-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"A business that when we bought it had a lot of opportunity for us to take cost out and have that flow to the bottom line with stable demand in an environment where industrial demand is going to increase the products for Signode will increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2020-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"We are all the cost you can imagine that you're taking out of the business, as well as some quality improvements, which we actually took somebody out of the Beverage business in Crown and put them in Transit to lead the quality effort and that's yielding tremendous cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2021-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"There is a container shortage across Asia right now, so getting containers timely is difficult and the price obviously is reflecting that and so you attempt to pass through those exceptional costs if and when you incur them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2021-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"So on your first question, yeah, we have pass-through mechanisms across many of the contracts in Europe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"In recent years we have invested for capacity expansion, innovation, cost reduction and upgrades to property, plant and equipment, including but not limited to new production lines, additional can and print capacity, auto packaging and light weighting, just to name a few.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2020 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Cost reduction so focused on projects designed to take out overhead and fixed costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2021-04-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were up 12% from the prior year, primarily due to increased volumes across all segments, favorable foreign currency translation and the pass through of higher material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2021-04-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"And as we contractually pass through the LME and the delivery premium, reported revenues will reflect both volume increases and the higher aluminum cost this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2021-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Adam Samuelson","x":"And just probably think about just the price mix, cost reduction, just try and think about the drivers of the significant operating leverage you saw in the Americas Beverage and same store again in European Beverage too, just trying to make sure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were up 34% from the prior year primarily due to increased volumes across all segments, favorable foreign currency translation, and the pass-through of higher material cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Leithead","x":"I was hoping could you give us how much the pass-through of aluminum and other input materials boosted sales year-over-year in the quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"As Tom discussed, we have raised full year guidance, and the expected closing of the Tinplate sale still remains in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kelly","x":"Net sales in the quarter were up 17% from the prior year, primarily due to the pass through of higher material costs and increased beverage can and transit packaging volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2021 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Reported revenues increased 17% during the quarter as higher beverage and transit volumes coupled with the pass through of raw material cost increases offset supply chain challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/crown-holdings-inc-cck-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Charles Clothier","x":"We're mindful of the potential impacts of tariffs that tariffs may have on the consumer and industrial activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Charles Clothier","x":"Considering the strong first half and the potential impacts from tariffs, we're raising our guidance for the full year adjusted EPS to $7.10 a share to $7.50 a share and project the third quarter adjusted EBITDA to be in the range of $1.95 a share to $2.05 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Charles Clothier","x":"…prior year quarter, primarily reflecting 1% higher shipments in North American beverage, a 7% increase across European beverage and a 5% increase in North American food can volumes, the pass-through of higher raw material costs and the favorable foreign exchange -- foreign currency translation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Fortunately for us, our contracts allow for the pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"So the charge we took for restructuring 2 principal items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"The second biggest piece is some further severance in Signode above the factory floor just to continue to rightsize what we believe is necessary to support a manufacturing business from the business we acquired several years ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q2","e":"cck","d":"2025-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Arun Shankar Viswanathan","x":"Just on free cash flow, you increased the guide there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/crown-cck-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"The effects of an uncertain and tariff-weary Mexican consumer combined with the coldest Brazilian winter in twenty years subdued demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/crown-holdings-cck-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Margins across Asia remained above 17 in the quarter despite lower Southeast Asian volumes at of 3% as Asian industries and consumers alike feel the pinch of higher tariffs to their economies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/crown-holdings-cck-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2025-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"We contractually pass through aluminum so the increased denominator effect will reduce percentage margins, not absolute margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/crown-holdings-cck-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2025-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"…Exchange increases and more specifically as the delivery premium stays higher, for longer we will have percentage margin impact especially in North America, that will flow through the Americas Beverage segment as we as pass through one for one the denominator gets bigger with the same dollar.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/crown-holdings-cck-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2025-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"George Leon Staphos","x":"Or is it purely cost reduction and your volume increase that drove the outperformance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/crown-holdings-cck-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2025-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"Considering our strong performance to date, we are raising our guidance for the full year adjusted EPS to $7.7 to $7.8 and project the fourth quarter adjusted EPS to be in the range of $1.65 to $1.75.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/crown-holdings-cck-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy Donahue","x":"Operationally, the teams performed very well to minimize the impacts from tariffs and the border conflict between Thailand and Cambodia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/crown-holdings-cck-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy Donahue","x":"While consumer purchasing power across the region remains subdued in the face of ongoing tariff concerns, we expect that our low-cost regional structure will allow commercial adjustments to drive volume growth in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/crown-holdings-cck-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Clothier","x":"Net sales in the quarter were up 8% compared to the prior year quarter, reflecting a 3% increase in global beverage can volumes, $189 million from the pass-through of higher raw material costs, and $58 million from favorable foreign exchange.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/crown-holdings-cck-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2025 Q4","e":"cck","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy Donahue","x":"When adjusted for the pass-through of higher aluminum costs, margins were within 30 basis points of last year's fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/crown-holdings-cck-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"It has been really the Midwest premium that has kind of been the proxy to absorb the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/crown-cck-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Other than the Supreme Court striking down some of the Liberation Day tariffs, 232 and 301 are largely unchanged.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/crown-cck-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2026-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Charles Clothier","x":"Net sales for the quarter were up 13% compared to the prior-year quarter, reflecting a 5% increase in global beverage can volumes, $234 million from the pass-through of higher raw material cost, and $74 million from favorable foreign exchange.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/crown-cck-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2026-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Turning to the operating segments, in Americas Beverage, sales increased by 16% in the quarter primarily reflecting the pass-through of higher material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/crown-cck-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q1","e":"cck","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Growth was notable across Vietnam, Cambodia, and China as results from our commercial adjustment strategy combined with recent cost reduction programs begin to bear fruit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/crown-cck-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2026-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Revenues in the Americas Beverage segment advanced 20% in the quarter primarily a result of $240 million in the pass through of higher metal costs higher sales unit volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/20/crown-cck-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2026-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Donahue","x":"Adjusting for the pass through of higher material costs segment income margin was 17.7% of sales in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/20/crown-cck-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CCK 2026 Q3","e":"cck","d":"2026-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joshua David Spector","x":"If I could shift gears quickly here, just on M&A, mean, there is plenty of noise going around on 1 of the smaller competitors about potential restructuring Can you just talk about your appetite for doing any